e opportunity for him to be in my  circle to be a part of what it is that I  do because he has really shown his self  that hey I really want to I really want  to do my best I really want to give back  it makes me feel great because I'm  helping someone and that's what my heart  desire is  [Music]  so the homecoming project pays my rent  for the first six months my six month  will be up next month after that I have  the option of either finding my own  place somewhere else or making my own  rental arrangement with candy my host  right now for me this is home and she's  expressed you know that I can stay here  forever if I want to and I don't see  myself moving anywhere I came to the Bay  Area not knowing where I was gonna live  you know coming out of prison but  Kenny's been like a mother to me the  moment I met her she told me welcome  home this is your home anything that I  can do for you any way that I can help  I'm here for you and I just thank God  for being here today a free man  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

